  <item>
    <title>Bucksport: data center moratorium — Enacted</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/bucksport-me</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-bucksport-me</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>Town Council approved 5-2 (Rankin and Doty opposed) a six-month (180-day) moratorium on data center development, covering all data centers, after a second reading and hearing; may be rescinded sooner if regulations are adopted. Vote date per Bangor Daily News (Thursday, Oct 8); WABI says Wednesday night (Oct 7). No ordinance text or town record read and effective date not stated, so no end date.</description>
  </item>
